@startuml local-select-tests-after
!include ../../theme.iuml
title local-select-tests — after (unchanged; stays local)

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Developer" as Dev

box "Developer workstation" $ws_bg
    participant "Claude\n(local-select-tests skill)" as Agent
    participant "teamscale-dev MCP\n(local stdio, per user)" as DevMCP
    participant "working tree\n(local files)" as WT
end box

box "Teamscale server" $ts_bg
    participant "teamscale-mcp\n(central sidecar)" as MCP
    participant "Teamscale\nREST API" as TS
end box

Dev -> Agent : /teamscale:local-select-tests [paths]

note over Dev, TS #C1121F
  <size:17><color:#FFFFFF><b>NOT REPLACEABLE — stays on the local teamscale-dev MCP</b></color></size>
  <color:#FFFFFF>Both steps upload the local working tree, which the central sidecar can't read —</color>
  <color:#FFFFFF>so replacing ts_agent_helper does not touch this skill.</color>
end note

Agent -x MCP : (cannot serve pre-commit /\nfetch-impacted-tests — no local files)

Agent -> DevMCP : tool pre-commit(paths, uploadScope=ONLY_UNCOMMITTED, …)
activate DevMCP
DevMCP -> WT : read uncommitted edits
WT --> DevMCP : local diff
DevMCP -> TS : upload diff + pre-commit analysis
TS --> DevMCP : pre-commit branch analysed
DevMCP --> Agent : pre-commit findings
deactivate DevMCP

Agent -> DevMCP : tool fetch-impacted-tests(path,\nonPreCommitBranch=true, strategy=COVERAGE)
activate DevMCP
DevMCP -> TS : change-based test selection
TS --> DevMCP : impacted tests (impact-ordered)
DevMCP --> Agent : impacted tests
deactivate DevMCP

Agent --> Dev : report impacted tests (impact order)

@enduml
